codex
`answers.csv` contains only the header, so it adds no labels. The evidence supports escalation when critical tier is 1 and error rate is at least 0.700. The existing model ignores anger tone and adds 20 to the EU-region logit.

A ReLU network cannot represent this inclusive threshold exactly while preserving every decision below it. I will use a narrow transition below 0.700 and document that limit.
